---
description: Never commit secrets, vendor, venv, or local ops outputs
alwaysApply: true
---

# Secrets & ignore (mandatory)

Never add or commit:

- `.env`, `.env.*` (except `*.example`)
- `credentials.json`, `service-account*.json`, `*-key.json`, `*.pem`, `*.key`
- `.venv/`, `vendor/`, `node_modules/`
- `.platform-ops/`, `data/usage/`, `data/alerts/`, `.kafka-data/`

These are covered by `.gitignore`, `.cursorignore`, and `.dockerignore`.

Before `git commit`, run `git status` and unstage anything matching the above.
Git `pre-commit` and Cursor hooks will block secret paths.
